            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>THE PROBLEM: Why the Perimeter Is Disappearing</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Why the Perimeter Is Disappearing ☁</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>Cloud &amp; SaaS Data and apps now live outside any single network boundary you control. ⌂ Remote Work Employees connect from home Wi-Fi, cafes, and airports -- not the office LAN. ⌘ BYOD &amp; Mobile Personal phones and laptops access corporate resources from everywhere. ⚠ Insider Risk Compromised or malicious insiders start out already &quot;inside&quot; the moat. EXAMPLE SCENARIO A logistics company migrates its scheduling system to a cloud SaaS platform and lets employees use personal laptops while working from home. There is no longer a single network edge to defend -- users, devices, and data are scattered across the internet. When an employee&#x27;s home router is compromised, the attacker reaches corporate cloud data directly, with no perimeter firewall ever in the path. 04 / 20</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "THE PROBLEM Why the Perimeter Is Disappearing ☁ Cloud & SaaS Data and apps now live outside any single network boundary you control. ⌂ Remote Work Employees connect from home Wi-Fi, cafes, and airports -- not the office LAN. ⌘ BYOD & Mobile Personal phones and laptops access corporate resources from everywhere. ⚠ Insider Risk Compromised or malicious insiders start out already \"inside\" the moat. EXAMPLE SCENARIO A logistics company migrates its scheduling system to a cloud SaaS platform and lets employees use personal laptops while working from home. There is no longer a single network edge to defend -- users, devices, and data are scattered across the internet. When an employee's home router is compromised, the attacker reaches corporate cloud data directly, with no perimeter firewall ever in the path. 04 / 20",
