            "lead": "Benefits of ZTA 05 / 20 Better Security and Less Damage",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>Benefits of ZTA</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">05 / 20 Better Security and Less Damage</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>Flexibility for Modern Work Control and Compliance ✓ ✓ ✓</p></div><ul class=\"compact mt-3\"><li>No lateral movement: Blocks hackers from moving around even if they break into one device.</li><li>Least privilege: Gives users access only to the exact tools they need for their jobs.</li><li>Continuous checks: Keeps checking user identity and device safety during the entire session.</li><li>Safe remote work: Protects company data when staff log in from home or public Wi-Fi.</li><li>Cloud ready: Secures apps and files moved to cloud servers without needing old VPN setups.</li><li>Device freedom: Allows personal phones and laptops (BYOD) to connect safely after passing checks.</li><li>Deep visibility: Tracks all network traffic and spots weird user behavior fast.</li><li>Easy rules: Simplifies security laws and helps meet standards like GDPR or HIPAA. [1]</li></ul>",
