            "lead": "CORE PRINCIPLE 01 Never Trust, Always Verify ?",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>CORE PRINCIPLE 01</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Never Trust, Always Verify ?</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>No implicit trust is granted based on network location, ownership, or prior access. Every user and device must prove who they are -- every time. ✓ Strong identity proof (MFA, not just passwords) ✓ Device health &amp; compliance checked at request time ✓ Access re-validated continuously, not just at login EVERY REQUEST, RE-VERIFIED 1 Who is asking? 2 What device? 3 What resource? 4 What context (time, location, risk)? 5 Is this the minimum needed? If the answer to any check changes, access changes with it -- in real time. 06 / 20</p></div>",
