            "rawHtml": "<h3>CORE PRINCIPLE 01</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Never Trust, Always Verify EXAMPLE SCENARIO</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>A finance director logs into the payroll portal every morning from the same office desk. Zero Trust still requires her MFA token each session, and if she suddenly tries to access the system from an unfamiliar country at 3 a.m., the system challenges her again and flags the session for review -- regardless of her seniority or past behavior. EVERY REQUEST, RE-VERIFIED 1 Who is asking? 2 What device? 3 What resource? 4 What context (time, location, risk)? 5 Is this the minimum needed? If the answer to any check changes, access changes with it -- in real time. 06 / 20</p></div>",
