            "lead": "PILLAR 1 OF 5 Identity & Access Management ⌘",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>PILLAR 1 OF 5</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Identity &amp; Access Management ⌘</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>Identity is the new perimeter. Strong, continuously-verified identity -- for people, services, and devices -- is the foundation every other Zero Trust control builds on.✓ Multi-factor authentication (MFA) on every login ✓ Single sign-on (SSO) with centralized policy ✓ Risk-based / adaptive authentication ✓ Just-in-time privilege elevation 10 / 20 ✓</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "PILLAR 1 OF 5 Identity & Access Management ⌘ Identity is the new perimeter. Strong, continuously-verified identity -- for people, services, and devices -- is the foundation every other Zero Trust control builds on.✓ Multi-factor authentication (MFA) on every login ✓ Single sign-on (SSO) with centralized policy ✓ Risk-based / adaptive authentication ✓ Just-in-time privilege elevation 10 / 20 ✓",
            "codeSnippets": [],
