            "lead": "MAKING IT WORK Continuous Monitoring & Analytics Zero Trust is not \"set and forget.\" Behavioral",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>MAKING IT WORK</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Continuous Monitoring &amp; Analytics Zero Trust is not &quot;set and forget.&quot; Behavioral</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>analytics and telemetry continuously reassess risk, feeding every access decision in real time. SIEM aggregates logs across identity, device, and network UEBA flags behavior that deviates from a user&#x27;s norm Automated response can revoke access within seconds 15 / 20</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "MAKING IT WORK Continuous Monitoring & Analytics Zero Trust is not \"set and forget.\" Behavioral analytics and telemetry continuously reassess risk, feeding every access decision in real time. SIEM aggregates logs across identity, device, and network UEBA flags behavior that deviates from a user's norm Automated response can revoke access within seconds 15 / 20",
