            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>MAKING IT WORK</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Continuous Monitoring &amp; Analytics EXAMPLE SCENARIO</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>A marketing account that normally logs in from one city suddenly authenticates successfully (with a stolen but valid password) from three different countries within an hour. The behavioral analytics engine flags the impossible-travel pattern, automatically suspends the session, and forces a re-verification -- stopping the account takeover before any data is accessed. RISK SIGNAL FEED Login -- New York, NY Normal Login -- Lagos, Nigeria (42 min later) Impossible travel Bulk file download initiated High risk Session auto-suspended Response triggered 15 / 20</p></div>",
