            "lead": "GETTING THERE Implementation Roadmap 1",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>GETTING THERE</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Implementation Roadmap 1</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>Assess Inventory identities, devices, data flows, and existing controls 2 Identity First Roll out MFA and SSO; retire shared/static credentials 3 Segment Introduce microsegmentation and device posture checks 4 Automate Policy Move from static rules to adaptive, risk-based policy 5 Monitor &amp; RefineDeploy analytics; continuously tune based on real signals 17 / 20</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "GETTING THERE Implementation Roadmap 1 Assess Inventory identities, devices, data flows, and existing controls 2 Identity First Roll out MFA and SSO; retire shared/static credentials 3 Segment Introduce microsegmentation and device posture checks 4 Automate Policy Move from static rules to adaptive, risk-based policy 5 Monitor & RefineDeploy analytics; continuously tune based on real signals 17 / 20",
